    "d": 742,
    "tags": [
     {
      "name": "Jamcharts",
      "notes": "> from \"NICU\", \"Prince Caspian\" is afloat upon the waves in Mexico again. Trey puts the proverbial \"extra mustard\" on his outro solo and he leads the band into an extended first set jam. Trey's licks lead the way and Fish returns in kind with fun interplay. Page's synths appear, before > \"Oblivion\"."
     }
    ]
